     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Questionnaire Ccc.b22.assessmentstests</b></p><a name=\"Ccc.b22.assessmentstests\"> </a><a name=\"hcCcc.b22.assessmentstests\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/STU4/StructureDefinition-sdc-questionnaire.html\">SDC Base Questionnaire</a></p></div><b>Structure</b><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder1\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder2\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The linkID for the item\">LinkID</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Text for the item\">Text</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the item can appear in the instance\">Cardinality</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The type of the item\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Other attributes of the item\">Flags</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Additional information about the item\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_q_root.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"QuestionnaireRoot\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Questionnaire</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">https://smart.who.int/ccc/Questionnaire/Ccc.b22.assessmentstests#0.1.0</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.force-collection\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / </span>force-collection</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=