g/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.a-FluidTest\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / </span>a-FluidTest</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">applicability-FluidTest</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / </span>Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck111.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE01\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-quantity.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"quantity\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / </span>Ccc.B22.DE01</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Respiratory Rate (breaths per minute)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-quantity\">quantity</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE01-help\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / Ccc.B22.DE01 / </span>Ccc.B22.DE01-help</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">&lt;b&gt;Count the number of breaths the child takes per minute&lt;/b&gt; to determine if fast breathing is present.&lt;br /&gt;\nIt is &lt;b&gt;very important that the child is calm&lt;/b&gt; and still. If the child is moving or crying, you will not be able to get an accurate count of breaths. &lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;b&gt;To count the breaths per minute,&lt;/b&gt; use a watch with a second hand or a digital watch. Look for the breathing movement anywhere on the child’s chest or abdomen. &lt;br /&gt;\nThe number of breaths for &lt;b&gt;‘fast breathing’ depends on the child’s age.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Under 2 months: More than 60 breaths per minute*&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;2 to 11 months: More than 50 breaths per minute&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;12 to 59 months: More than 40 breaths per minute&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;*In young infants, a second measurement should be taken to confirm, unless there is already another sign of possible serious bacterial infection</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE02\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / </span>Ccc.B22.DE02</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE02\">1 option</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck111.png)\" id=\"item.second\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / </span>second</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1111.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE04\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-quantity.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"quantity\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / second / </span>Ccc.B22.DE04</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Respiratory Rate Second Count (breaths per minute)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-quantity\">quantity</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11100.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE04-help\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / second / Ccc.B22.DE04 / </span>Ccc.B22.DE04-help</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">&lt;b&gt;Count the number of breaths the child takes per minute&lt;/b&gt; to determine if fast breathing is present.&lt;br /&gt;\nIt is &lt;b&gt;very important that the child is calm&lt;/b&gt; and still. If the child is moving or crying, you will not be able to get an accurate count of breaths. &lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;b&gt;To count the breaths per minute,&lt;/b&gt; use a watch with a second hand or a digital watch. Look for the breathing movement anywhere on the child’s chest or abdomen. &lt;br /&gt;\nThe number of breaths for &lt;b&gt;‘fast breathing’ depends on the child’s age.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;ul&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;Under 2 months: More than 60 breaths per minute*&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;2 to 11 months: More than 50 breaths per minute&lt;/li&gt;\n		&lt;li&gt;12 to 59 months: More than 40 breaths per minute&lt;/li&gt;\n	&lt;/ul&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;*In young infants, a second measurement should be taken to confirm, unless there is already another sign of possible serious bacterial infection</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE05\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / second / </span>Ccc.B22.DE05</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE05\">1 option</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck101.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE07\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / </span>Ccc.B22.DE07</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Fast Breathing</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaire-definitions.html#Questionnaire.item.readOnly\" title=\"Is Read Only\"><img src=\"icon-qi-readonly.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-readonly.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1000.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE07-help\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.RespiratoryRate / Ccc.B22.DE07 / </span>Ccc.B22.DE07-help</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">The number of breaths for &lt;b&gt;‘fast breathing’ depends on the child’s age.&lt;/b&gt;   * Under 2 months: More than 60 breaths per minute* * 2 to 11 months: More than 50 breaths per minute * 12 to 59 months: More than 40 breaths per minute  *In young infants, a second measurement should be taken to confirm, unless there is already another sign of possible serious bacterial infection</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.FluidTest\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-group.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"group\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / </span>Ccc.B22.FluidTest</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-group\">group</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck111.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE08\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE08</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Oral Fluid Test Results</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE08\">5 options</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE08-help\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-display.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"display\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.FluidTest / Ccc.B22.DE08 / </span>Ccc.B22.DE08-help</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">If a child is unconscious do not try to carry out an oral fluid test (Exact wording &lt;span class=\"caps\"&gt;TBC&lt;/span&gt;) &amp;#8211; Pop Up&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;If a breastfeeding assessment and an Oral Fluid test is recommended for a child that is only breastfed then a pop up is required to ensure that the health care worker observes the signs for both and provides results for both tests. &lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Oral Fluid Test&lt;br /&gt;\nIf it is not possible to perform an oral fluid test, the health care worker should assume that the child is vomiting everything&lt;br /&gt;\nFor a child under 6 months the health care worker can offer for the mother to breastfeed instead of receiving fluids&lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Caution: Do not force fluids into an unconscious child , it can be dangerous. The fluid can cause them to choke or the fluid can go into their lungs. &lt;/p&gt;\n\n	&lt;p&gt;Pop up box to be made available with instructions on how to carry out an oral fluid test.&lt;br /&gt;\nAdditional information &lt;span class=\"caps\"&gt;TBC&lt;/span&gt;</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-display\">display</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE14\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE14</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">null</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-choice\">choice</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Options: <a href=\"#opt-item.Ccc.B22.DE14\">1 option</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE14a\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-boolean.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"boolean\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Ccc.B22.AssessmentsTests / Ccc.B22.FluidTest / </span>Ccc.B22.DE14a</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Completely Unable to Drink or Vomits Immediately / Everything</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-hidden.html\" title=\"Is a hidden item\"><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-hidden.png\" alt=\"\"/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extension-questionnaire-choiceorientation.html\" title=\"Orientation: horizontal \"><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-horizontal.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" id=\"item.Ccc.B22.DE15\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" styl